  "prefLabel": "Ins 1908.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1908.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to authorize the New Hampshire Individual Health Plan Benefit Association, an existing entity established pursuant to RSA 404-G, to operate a new mechanism for risk adjustment and subsidization to assist health carriers who have issued individual health insurance policies on or after September 23, 2010 to children under the age of 19, as required by federal law.\n\nSource. #10023, eff 11-14-11",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins1900.html"
}
